// Genesis AIR — a native AIR non-linear editor.
//
//   genesis-air render OUT.png [PROJECT]      paint one frame headlessly
//   genesis-air demo   OUT.png [PROJECT.air]  build a small project, edit it, save, paint
//   genesis-air open   PROJECT.air            open a window on an existing project
//   genesis-air audio  OUT.wav PROJECT.air    mix audible timeline for inspection
//   genesis-air new                           open a window on a new project
//
// The window path needs a display; every other path is headless, which is what the tests
// use and what makes this application checkable without a screen.
module genesis.main

